# Drum & Dance January 13th

  Join us for a day of drum and dance to welcome the New Year. This will be our first event back for 2018 and a great opportunity to get your drum and dance dose for the holiday period or try the classes out for the first time in preparation for all the new classes starting on February 6th. There will be live drumming for the dance classes and loads of awesome and exciting new material. It will also be your last chance to catch a class with Nathaniel before he heads off to Africa for a month! **All classes are $15.00,  and are for all levels.**

[BOOK NOW!](/product/rhythm-culture-drum-dance-2018-january-13th/)

